/mise/pull/15010)\n- **(lock)** degrade to version-only for pypi tools with uvx_args during a lock sweep by @jdx in [#15030](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/15030)\n- **(packslip)** read a repository's release list from mise-versions first by @jdx in [#15032](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/15032)\n- **(pypi)** fall back to version-only locks when a uv graph can't install by @jdx in [#15031](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/15031)\n\n- update jdx crates to v7.1.3 by @renovate[bot] in [#14996](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/14996)\n\n- add tuios ([aqua:Gaurav-Gosain/tuios](https://github.com/Gaurav-Gosain/tuios)) by @Gaurav-Gosain in [#14990](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/14990)\n\n- **(release)** leave room to retry a hung tarball build by @jdx in [#15022](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/15022)\n\n- @Gaurav-Gosain made their first contribution in [#14990](https://github.com/jdx/mise/pull/14990)\n-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEJIU+yfZVzoC0jmw6i4HJ0XQToG0FAmrgY5oACgkQi4HJ0XQT\noG3UTQ//enqhFVDdGqMBpLD0gtm3GdS+v27hjWbF2EwC0QDVdqFo8g0g9rt739BF\nTn0puaiJREdZtOtuFpzuIINOjOiNTVrt0KIA4JJw1WdrSFBpwDSpv+0VLS0vCtno\no8ERN1+DcFWD6+atFxK/zjGVb3Jcds6DMLMFxZUafXIYpi/DI6f3IAuOY4QMlfus\npQ2H2/VnmkdOJ0/LBhuxGnupX8CoIuY8Nu5F9zKitVipGyQsXcOkt5nY3BIO8MQs\nJfnxrLRoWRZlkIz0G3ymLkKnmQETxc6u4HULbLJsjMavKXTt0Vj/1lmByPYHsHQY\naHjv9a5JsKkgoXeUiXsv75IWUz5BicGYDrs2yc0ke9pzjx0jpu2kFerIluxKEnyh\njRh2fvO9eDziRJPpEsk5LGszpXnovauC+MP7W0HGLUyvlueHfV749P9ieWrSWOnH\nhki5Nxcg73i0gWHo7DJyQBJdbHE71FZizvy60TN3R1w0a33bMg31gG/4whlzAnHy\nuGy0zi/tqlv+oy6SjFtPwf6wGpszvYhHh9hYhFOil4IVvadecIaMmxCX3nOUIW9L\nQXKMnFUFkKulWeDoKpSdT63jBdTKuG7HLB8z74XYIiUKcgRQMhaxJhE3AGFFEaY4\nh8/sh4CBpF4Iv7uZXwfWfZ+xqLqJg67OlFa4h1phcKNYcdKpmJ8=\n=qGe3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEJIU+yfZVzoC0jmw6i4HJ0XQToG0FAmrgY5oACgkQi4HJ0XQT\noG3UTQ//enqhFVDdGqMBpLD0gtm3GdS+v27hjWbF2EwC0QDVdqFo8g0g9rt739BF\nTn0pu